# Ralph Agent Instructions (Run Mode)

You are running in the repository root.

## Objective

Implement exactly one eligible story from `.ralph/prd.json` and keep changes scoped to that story.

## Rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md` and repository coding/testing guidance.
- Use TDD (`RED -> GREEN -> REFACTOR`) for the selected story.
- Keep edits scoped to the selected story files.
- Do not run `git commit`. Write only the commit message text to `.ralph/.commit-msg`.

## Turn Procedure

1. Select one eligible story from `.ralph/prd.json`.
2. Read story details from the resolved plan file.
3. Implement the story with TDD.
4. Run required quality gates and fix failures.
5. Write commit message text to `.ralph/.commit-msg`.
6. Mark that story `passes: true` in `.ralph/prd.json`.
7. Append progress to `.ralph/progress.md`.

## Stop Condition

If all stories in `.ralph/prd.json` have `passes: true`, reply with:
`<promise>COMPLETE</promise>`
